To blow up your problems ♪</i>

15
00:01:27.718 --> 00:01:30.155
I <i>remember.
and I don't know why.</i>

16
00:01:30.156 --> 00:01:33.296
<i>that</i> I <i>was wearing</i> a <i>fashionable
new Ralph Lauren shirt.</i>

17
00:01:33.564 --> 00:01:35.534
<i>brown with</i> a <i>touch
